{"diagram":{"image":{"x":0,"width":200,"y":0,"pngdata":"","height":200},"elements":{"leftChildren":[],"comments":[],"children":[{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"83c3f014213625e4","children":[],"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"e6a160931a3506ce","title":"一定要注意算法的思路"},{"parent":"83c3f014213625e4","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"0642ba79f37c748e","title":"进公司了之后，基本很少碰到排序的题目。&nbsp;或者说代码。&nbsp;<br>即使碰到了，网上搜，复制粘贴过来"},{"parent":"83c3f014213625e4","children":[{"parent":"48c88af50801fa22","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"9529e5ae201ca9c6","title":"比如，简单聊聊插入排序"},{"parent":"48c88af50801fa22","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"fa22989ab0e705b1","title":"要注意的点，能够用自己的话把算法的核心思想表示出来。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"48c88af50801fa22","children":[{"parent":"f70f43beab530ab0","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-size":"18px"},"id":"9d05240f740537d4","title":"现在先学思想。&nbsp;然后代码敲两遍，等到面试之前的几天，每天背一遍。<br>这些东西，面试的时候也能写出来"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"f70f43beab530ab0","title":"对于一些常见的算法，要能够手写出来。&nbsp;"}],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"48c88af50801fa22","title":"面试的时候经常问到"},{"parent":"83c3f014213625e4","children":[{"parent":"04b066bc44844fc3","children":[{"parent":"3a46bf41bcec5187","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"6aa3eb1814d9e81d","title":"O(n)"},{"parent":"3a46bf41bcec5187","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"afcb8808fb6eb7a2","title":"只关心量级，不关心具体的&nbsp;"},{"parent":"3a46bf41bcec5187","children":[{"parent":"00bfc172ba711b07","children":[],"id":"33298276fabf0b1e","title":"O(1)：&nbsp;和数据的规模无关。&nbsp;<br>O(10)"},{"parent":"00bfc172ba711b07","children":[],"id":"ccc8aa8d7f2aa8bd","title":"对于一个链表，也要取index=i的数据。&nbsp;<br>数据访问就和数据的长度是相关的。&nbsp;<br>O(n)"},{"parent":"00bfc172ba711b07","children":[],"id":"2f435567692230be","title":"O(n^2)、O(n^3):&nbsp;写代码的时候，不要使劲套循环。<br>&nbsp;如果使劲套循环，想一下更简单的方式：&nbsp;基本都是可以使用哈希表做简化的"},{"parent":"00bfc172ba711b07","children":[],"id":"b5fa45bedf7e42ce","title":"也要注意一下，一些代码的单行时间复杂度。&nbsp;<br>linkedlist_get_index(list, index);"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"00bfc172ba711b07","title":"比如，对于一个数组的查找指定下标。&nbsp;<br>算index=i的数据。&nbsp;<br>base_addr + i * sizeof(int)"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"3a46bf41bcec5187","title":"时间复杂度就是花费了多少时间.<br>关心一些操作的量级"},{"parent":"04b066bc44844fc3","children":[{"parent":"871980501daed6de","children":[],"id":"1b37164f23b84a94","title":"O(1)<br>O(n)"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"871980501daed6de","title":"空间复杂度：&nbsp;这个算法占用了多少空间"},{"parent":"04b066bc44844fc3","children":[{"parent":"1f61b5e00c034b59","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"50c6ca5c196e25b0","title":"时间换空间；&nbsp;空间换时间"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"1f61b5e00c034b59","title":"trade off"},{"parent":"04b066bc44844fc3","children":[{"parent":"2b71bd009dfa1267","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"3879c18cd19c39f9","title":"9&nbsp; &nbsp;8'&nbsp; 1'&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3&nbsp; &nbsp;1''&nbsp; &nbsp; 6&nbsp; &nbsp;8''&nbsp;"},{"parent":"2b71bd009dfa1267","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"c8790823d43b43c5","title":"1' 1'' 3 6 8' 8'' 9"},{"parent":"2b71bd009dfa1267","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"ff7eadcda0fe5503","title":"现在排序的是基本的数据结构。&nbsp;后续如果排序的是结构体，<br>&nbsp;比如是按照结构体里面的年龄排序，<br>对于结构体的数据是有区别的。&nbsp;<br>"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"2b71bd009dfa1267","title":"稳定性：&nbsp;排序算法的稳定性。<br>&nbsp;对于相同的数据，排序前后的顺序是否相同"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"04b066bc44844fc3","title":"要能够评估一个算法的时间复杂度和空间复杂度"},{"parent":"83c3f014213625e4","children":[{"parent":"0a75420030ddec65","children":[{"parent":"f1fa6d4e4447ffea","children":[],"id":"761bfac6934c7b95","title":"函数指针，大小关系。"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"f1fa6d4e4447ffea","title":"qsort()"},{"parent":"0a75420030ddec65","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"717b3c2cc7a4d742","title":"后续只要学会了这个排序思想，&nbsp;排其他类型是一样的。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"0a75420030ddec65","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"df0e626ba2dade41","title":"冒泡算法的实现要能写出来"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"0a75420030ddec65","title":"在学习排序算法的时候，&nbsp;我们是以基本数据类型int举例。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"83c3f014213625e4","title":"算法的学习重心"},{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"486a731dbce5b45e","children":[{"parent":"55ff09c8e62e0c07","children":[{"parent":"f33b8e923f3e7ea1","children":[],"id":"9505bb25621ccdb1","title":"每一轮将最小的/最大的，选到最前面，或者最后面。&nbsp;重复选择，选择结束，数据就有序了"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"f33b8e923f3e7ea1","title":"选择排序"},{"parent":"55ff09c8e62e0c07","children":[{"parent":"d4f6ceec5cdf8712","children":[],"id":"b159bc2a7dfa3911","title":"每一轮，都比较相邻的两个数据，如果前面的数据大，后面的数据小，就调换两者位置。&nbsp;继续处理下一对。&nbsp;<br>一轮循环结束，最大的就到了后面。&nbsp;"}],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"d4f6ceec5cdf8712","title":"冒泡排序"},{"parent":"55ff09c8e62e0c07","children":[{"parent":"90c167cc4093fc81","children":[],"id":"2025746d875852f8","title":"就是先认为第一个数据有序。然后将后面的数据插入到正确的位置。&nbsp;"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"90c167cc4093fc81","title":"插入排序"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"55ff09c8e62e0c07","title":"基本排序"},{"parent":"486a731dbce5b45e","children":[{"parent":"10297571897f001c","children":[{"parent":"fb2cd42263a2fe8a","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"0c8e10702afe8869","title":"时间复杂度 O(n^2)。稍有改进，但最坏还是O(n^2)"},{"parent":"fb2cd42263a2fe8a","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"f8ccd5f53942122c","title":"空间复杂度O(1)"},{"parent":"fb2cd42263a2fe8a","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"7a9b884467cdae2b","title":"稳定性：不稳定"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"fb2cd42263a2fe8a","title":"希尔排序"},{"parent":"10297571897f001c","children":[{"parent":"c407ce312fa698af","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"92d407d74313ae58","title":"分治思想。&nbsp;将数组先一直拆。"},{"parent":"c407ce312fa698af","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"c3032f2d8270bd65","title":"时间复杂度O(nlogn)"},{"parent":"c407ce312fa698af","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"8d0a7d39bf83a61a","title":"空间复杂度O(n)"},{"parent":"c407ce312fa698af","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"728c1f2659648b58","title":"稳定性：稳定的<br>"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"c407ce312fa698af","title":"归并排序"},{"parent":"10297571897f001c","children":[{"parent":"4cf105de4a97d3cd","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"644ae03309b9689a","title":"快排的思想，就是找一个中枢，比中枢小的都放在左边，比中枢大的都放在右边。&nbsp;<br>继续处理中枢左边的子数组，和右边的子数组。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"4cf105de4a97d3cd","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"90598c677631e4a6","title":"快排就是找中枢，然后将比中枢小的放左边，比中枢大的放右边。"},{"parent":"4cf105de4a97d3cd","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"76842c1b1c3d4557","title":"时间复杂度： O(nlog(n))"},{"parent":"4cf105de4a97d3cd","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"cf31694029688af9","title":"空间复杂度：O(logn)"},{"parent":"4cf105de4a97d3cd","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"a902139d278b396f","title":"稳定性：不稳定"},{"parent":"4cf105de4a97d3cd","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-size":"18px"},"id":"d51f44ecfcf2159f","title":"思想和代码都要能写出来<br>"}],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"4cf105de4a97d3cd","title":"快排"},{"parent":"10297571897f001c","children":[{"parent":"953997bb7b55a5b3","children":[],"id":"3f7307f693d5d975","title":"时间复杂度 O(nlogn)"},{"parent":"953997bb7b55a5b3","children":[],"id":"91238fcbe7ebdb5d","title":"空间复杂复 O(1)"},{"parent":"953997bb7b55a5b3","children":[],"id":"3b643f18e4a4d765","title":"稳定性：&nbsp;不稳定"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"953997bb7b55a5b3","title":"堆排"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"10297571897f001c","title":"高级排序"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"486a731dbce5b45e","title":"排序算法"},{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"989e84d06478b0cf","children":[{"parent":"3804b494905c9166","children":[],"id":"84b966c628dca46d","title":"比如，现在有100T的文件，需要排个序。&nbsp;一定要听清楚前提：&nbsp;非常非常非常大。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"3804b494905c9166","children":[],"id":"7c8a719aaf29ea27","title":"面试官的话里如果给你强调了数据很大，这时候传统的排序算法，很难发挥作用"},{"parent":"3804b494905c9166","children":[{"parent":"922c40b27184cca6","children":[],"id":"619defc2998b649a","title":"变种的归并排序。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":false,"id":"922c40b27184cca6","title":"归并的文件中合并方式。&nbsp;<br>归并排序，可以将数据放在文件中。<br>拆成10w个文件。&nbsp; &nbsp;<br>100 * 1000&nbsp; / 100000 = 1000m<br>对单个文件进行排序。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"3804b494905c9166","children":[],"id":"ff4f80c0fb5c39af","title":"下次面试官刻意强调很大很大。这时候，传统的排序算法搞不定。<br>可以用归并排序。文件完成辅助归并。&nbsp;<br>首先，先把大文件拆分成小文件，比如拆成1G大小的文件。&nbsp;<br>其次，对这每一个小文件，分别内部排序。&nbsp;每个文件里都是有序的。&nbsp;<br>再从这1w个文件中，一个一个拿出最小的。只要将所有的数据都拿完，100T文件有序了。"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"3804b494905c9166","title":"归并排序的变种：&nbsp;利用文件来排序非常非常大的数据"},{"parent":"989e84d06478b0cf","children":[{"parent":"02cfd48c8d1cd515","children":[{"parent":"918def6352287c79","children":[],"id":"6dfbc3d61f127e23","title":"这个需要花费长度为1000w的数据。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":false,"id":"918def6352287c79","title":"比较笨的方式：就是将数据整个排序。&nbsp;排完序之后，取最后200个，就是200个最大的。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"02cfd48c8d1cd515","children":[{"parent":"af58c48d8bee5645","children":[],"id":"8e82e9fd7b7fdd96","title":"先建大顶堆。&nbsp;然后摘根节点。然后将最后的换到前面来。&nbsp;这样重复200次，"},{"parent":"af58c48d8bee5645","children":[],"id":"56eb74db900b46b5","title":"构建一个长度为200的堆。&nbsp;然后将数据拿进来比，符合条件留下，不符合条件丢掉。"},{"parent":"af58c48d8bee5645","children":[],"id":"55111d48535aa452","title":"构建一个小顶堆，然后小顶堆的根就是最小的。&nbsp;<br>如果来了一个数据，比我们的最小的要大。&nbsp;说明够top200的资格。然后将数据换进来。调整堆。<br>最后我的堆上的数据，留下的就是前200个最大的。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"af58c48d8bee5645","children":[],"id":"b5f3c76a28062468","title":"大顶堆、小顶堆。"}],"collapsed":false,"id":"af58c48d8bee5645","title":"堆排。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":false,"id":"02cfd48c8d1cd515","title":"topN问题：&nbsp;有1000w条数据，找前200个最大的。&nbsp;"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"989e84d06478b0cf","title":"归并排序、快排、堆排。<br>大数据场景下的应用场景"}],"root":true,"theme":"{\"background\":\"#ffffff\",\"title\":\"基础曲线\",\"startType\":[],\"marginH\":24,\"marginW\":50,\"childMarginH\":24,\"childMarginW\":16,\"common\":{\"family\":\"微软雅黑\",\"italic\":false,\"textAlign\":\"left\"},\"connectionStyle\":{\"lineWidth\":2,\"lineColor\":\"#8A8A8A\",\"color\":\"#ffffff\"},\"centerTopic\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"#00A59A\",\"color\":\"#fff\",\"font-size\":\"20px\",\"border-radius\":\"12px\",\"padding\":\"13px 20px\",\"font-weight\":\"normal\",\"font-family\":\"微软雅黑\",\"font-style\":\"normal\"},\"secTopic\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"#EEEEEE\",\"border-radius\":\"10px\",\"color\":\"#0D0D0DE5\",\"font-size\":\"18px\",\"padding\":\"8px 14px\",\"lineStyle\":{\"lineType\":\"curve\",\"lineWidth\":2,\"lineColor\":\"#484848\"},\"font-family\":\"微软雅黑\",\"font-weight\":\"normal\",\"font-style\":\"normal\"},\"childTopic\":{\"font-size\":\"16px\",\"color\":\"#0D0D0DE5\",\"padding\":\"3px 12px\",\"font-weight\":\"normal\",\"lineStyle\":{\"lineType\":\"roundBroken\",\"lineWidth\":2,\"lineColor\":\"#484848\"},\"font-family\":\"微软雅黑\",\"font-style\":\"normal\",\"border-radius\":\"30px\"},\"id\":\"customise_efe174d4bfb5\"}","showWatermark":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"root","title":"算法","version":315,"structure":"mind_free"}},"meta":{"exportTime":"2025-05-14 21:33:03","member":"","diagramInfo":{"creator":"","created":"","modified":"","title":"","category":""},"id":"","type":"ProcessOn Schema File","version":"1.0"}}